  "body": "We are proud to present this modern and stylish 3-bedroom, 1.5-bathroom duplex home, ideally located in the heart of Silverdale—one of North Auckland’s fastest-growing and most desirable communities. This property offers an exceptional opportunity for convenient, low maintenance living.\r\n\r\nKey features include:\r\n• Freehold title with 121m² (more or less) land area and approximately 97m² floor area, with no body corporate or association fees\r\n• 3 spacious bedrooms and 1.5 well-appointed bathrooms\r\n• Allocated car park in front plus additional visitor parking\r\n• Contemporary kitchen fitted with premium Fisher & Paykel appliances, complemented by quality inclusions such as Gree air conditioning, a digital door lock, double-glazed windows, underfloor heating, and LED illuminated\r\nvanity mirrors and much more\r\n• 10-year Stamford Building Insurance Warranty for peace of mind\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in the vibrant Silverdale community, this home is just minutes from motorway access, excellent schools, shopping centres, cafés, public transport, and beautiful beaches—offering everything you need for a comfortable and connected lifestyle.\r\n\r\nWhether you are a first-home buyer, downsizer, or investor, this property represents a smart and secure opportunity in a thriving location.\r\n\r\nDon’t miss out—contact us today to arrange a private viewing or attend one of our open homes.",
